  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『まずは、一曲目……ご清聴くださり、ありがとうございました』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『あらためまして、こんにちは。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『わたしはアイドルユニット『merry-melody』の花音ことりといいます』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『わたしはアイドルをやっていて、さいきん駆け出しの、ひよっこアイドルです』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『だから……こうやって身近にいる、ひとりひとりのファンを大事にして、歌声を届けようと思って、』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『今日はこの病院へとやってきました』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『いわゆる、『一日ナース企画』というやつです。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『今日は一日、白衣の天使として、みんなに歌声を届けますので、よろしくお願いします♪』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『わたしがどうして、筆談で話しているのか、ですか？』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『そうですね、事務所の規定で、歌声以外は聞かせられないことになっているんです。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『歌の練習はしているけど、アドリブは苦手なので、緊張で声が裏返らないように、という感じです』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『ところで、今回は病院でライブするということで、白衣を着てきました☆』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『白衣の天使……なんて言うと、いま仕事をされている看護士さんのほうが、よっぽど天使ですけれど。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-nurse",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-nurse_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『とりあえず、本日はナース服で歌いますので、よろしくお願いします☆』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『あはは。声援ありがとうございます。名前を憶えていてもらえると、とても嬉しいです♪』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "『おや、ご年配の方まで。あたたかい声援ありがとうございます☆』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 25,
